  "title": "Google's Gemini AI Revolutionizes Spreadsheets with Auto Charts",
  "summary": "Google introduces Gemini AI for Google Sheets, a groundbreaking feature that transforms spreadsheet data into insightful charts automatically. By generating Python code or using formulas, Gemini offers static image outputs that enhance your data storytelling. Available on most Workspace plans by February 2025, this new tool is set to democratize data visualization—but watch out for its static nature, requiring manual updates for new data.",
